  <item>
    <title>在名利场的橱窗前，我选择照见自己</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a79af4d36641f136d8602ec</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a79af4d36641f136d8602ec</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 11:04:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>什么才是更好的生活？住进大房子、开上豪车……标准到底在哪儿？</span></p><p><span>我们天生渴望更多，却又总在无休止的对比里内耗；好像一直在被推着往前走，但拥有的越多，越不敢停下来。世俗把物质光鲜塑造成唯一的成功范本，局限住我们看待生活的眼界。</span></p><p><span>这期节目想和你聊聊：沉迷世俗标准，其实是走进了一条狭窄隧道。当我们挣脱攀比催生的欲望枷锁，褪去对浮华的盲目追捧，才会看见人生的多种可能性。</span></p><p><span>不必紧盯橱窗里不属于自己的风光，不必拿别人的刻度丈量人生。或许“更好的生活”从来没有标准答案，你的感受，才是唯一标尺。愿你完成内心的祛媚，放下无尽比较，活出松弛自在、取悦自己的生活。</span></p><p></p><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a></span></u></a><span> 开篇引入</span></p><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a></span></u></a><span> 读懂「袪媚」：我们终其一生，在褪去滤镜</span></p><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="464">07:44</a></span></u></a><span> 名利场的隧道视野：名利正在困住我们的人生</span></p><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a></span></u></a><span> 世界辽阔，不必困于一隅：用宏大的世界稀释痛苦，用微小的事物感知幸福</span></p><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1188">19:48</a></span></u></a><span> 重新定义「更好的生活」</span></p><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a></span></u></a><span> 结尾互动</span></p><p></p><p><span>【入群】：更多图文信息、精彩活动，欢迎关注微信公众号【找自己FIND SELF】</span></p><p></p><p><span>主播：iii</span></p><p><span>嘉宾：蛋黄派、平行线</span></p><p><br></p>]]></description>
